{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "756dac26756ba56d46261b74806374790989d5ef5896571a0de7510cb09d28a4", "ja": "4th Track　君たちのスピードで", "zh": "4th Track　按你们的步调", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8089590992e676b16049e798d3c32fc520109ebd9dbc758bdbbc4447b6235e5e", "ja": "演奏に自信がなく、遅いテンポで練習を続け\nるメンバーに、プロデューサーは速度を上げ\nる事を提案する。ためらう一同だったが、プ\nロデューサーに諭されて挑戦を決意！　数時\n間後、見事に演奏し切ってみせるのだった。", "zh": "对于对演奏没有信心、一直以较慢速度练习的成员，制作人提议提高速度。  \n虽然大家都有些犹豫，但在制作人的劝导下，还是决定发起挑战！  \n几小时后，她们竟然出色地完成了整段演奏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "5de37347cd192d550f98922406b32ccfa236b1bd4b0e9f128dc74f791f220e31", "ja": "おはようございます！　今日も\nバンドの練習、張り切っていっちゃいましょ～！", "zh": "早上好！今天也打起精神来练习乐队吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "e42dc8a20e056e2bc1a104085ae2165f3333dd02974c15dc13623157e61ecba7", "ja": "それでは……恵美ちゃん、可奈ちゃん！　本日の\nトラック再生速度は、どれくらいにしましょう！", "zh": "那么……惠美、小可奈！今天的曲目播放速度，我们调到多少合适呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "8c646669fe3c485420bc5f4a3abf68653101a750d1cbe7755b079836216c8fa8", "ja": "ん～、そうだな～。\n今日こそは50％……。", "zh": "嗯～，是啊～。今天一定要……50％……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "d32d4649b915b0a71e8a45cdc741fce2259a5a52ae7537864c74b5dfa3dfb814", "ja": "25％でお願いします！！！", "zh": "请给我来25％的！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8b0d7a3cf85c2784dbf7a35a7f8cf7542cd5d3d1bbe6e5caf459c705db1bcae1", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nけど、いいのか？　ずっと25%だけど……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n不过，真的没问题吗？一直都只有25%……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "c7f27d891a8c04d7b7e4223c0201308de9172725d0f131e0361a8b9907e34eca", "ja": "ううっ、{$P$}さんごめんなさい～。\nでも、私、まだ自信がなくて……。", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生对不起啦～  \n可是，我还没有自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "335fc09720431a03ca60f4264e8bf7aa15a9d46502f35160f446fb530612688c", "ja": "スピード上げると演奏ヘロヘロ～♪\nボロがボロボロ～……♪", "zh": "一提速演奏就变得软绵绵的～♪\n破绽一个接一个～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "9b22ee1326fcdd0e186b12824a9e688d4b1580fc8fa65e28038ccad469ac939c", "ja": "そう？　でもジュリアは、可奈のコトほめてたよ。\n楽器の筋がいいって！", "zh": "是吗？不过茱莉亚可是夸过可奈哦。\n说她很有演奏乐器的天赋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "c3cad576eae9ed8136b3e836a8af03aa06df0adb2ddb332824ac4a8dc0ad23ba", "ja": "ジュリアさんにほめてもらえたのはうれしいですけど、\n家でも50％にすると、全然弾けなくって……。", "zh": "能得到茱莉亚先生的夸奖，我很开心，可是在家里也调到50％，还是完全弹不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "24c3ccefd7ea7acbbb7dee750623ff4f506015c6a0041fe913d2699c135118f7", "ja": "ううっ、どうしたら上手になるのかな～？", "zh": "呜呜，怎样才能弹得更好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b2c1219677eee45dfc464689fc719e7cf3dccbac52fec9ef592b4385f511aed6", "ja": "難しいフレーズだけ後で練習することにして、\nいったん全体を仕上げてみるとか……？", "zh": "要不先把难的乐句留到之后练习，暂时先把整体完成看看……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "0891c78ea0b8a05f63369b26c8a475eac2225c888281e41d7b3f823d4e11e30d", "ja": "それもやってみたんですけど、途中で\n失敗しちゃうと、うわ～！って慌てちゃって……。", "zh": "我也试过那样做，可是中途一旦失败，就会慌得“哇——！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "80c27972ad712de6da7839e16d21c7067886ee53d038ca107b4b42c067dbd1d1", "ja": "一回乗り遅れると、その後、どうしても\n演奏に入っていけなくなっちゃうんです……。", "zh": "一旦跟不上节奏，之后就怎么都没法进入演奏状态了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "420a08820c709cec8bdd6fef8d37d9a895cec0baf6ecd580738ee5c3d15657b0", "ja": "なるほど……。\nそれなら尚更、50％で続けてみないか？", "zh": "原来如此……。\n那样的话，就更要不要试着以50％的状态继续下去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "788710932ebc34c09cf9da71e4ff98817824d52d4fa86258dda9dc0e9929bd46", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうしてですかぁ？", "zh": "诶！？为、为什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7a9ed1d9c88f6ae1f6ac3269ee4e6b95510d7b412936ecdaa13e98ba765334fe", "ja": "練習でうまくいかなかったところが、本番で\nいきなり弾けるようになることはまずないけど……。", "zh": "练习时没能顺利完成的部分，基本不可能在正式演出时突然就能弹好了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5351576e82d65ccde2929c35a93748fd2df400d6c828f15e8a27568ebd0b108f", "ja": "練習できちんとできたところなのに、本番で\n何故か失敗してしまう……そういう事もあるだろ？", "zh": "明明是练习时已经好好完成的部分，却不知为何在正式演出时失败了……这种情况也是有的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "d18d08b95e7f6b480e491aed35ef4328d6e08c327a1d9db39dd10a922032a001", "ja": "うわぁ……{$P$}ってば、やなコト\n言わないでよ～！　心配になってきちゃったじゃん！", "zh": "哇……{$P$}真是的，别说这种\n扫兴的话嘛～！害人家都开始担心起来了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "3ef37289a644e7d70330a130698d4baf6534fcfe31c5c6c845b3699195eacfd1", "ja": "あ、ありさも、心当たりありまくりです……ううっ！", "zh": "啊，亚利沙也有太多切身体会了……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3eb2040e7758e65e27786d7fcf55a7e54ee81e73ed8ab16e13758e5b4261da8a", "ja": "まあこれは、バンドというより、アイドルの\nプロデュースを通じて得た経験だけどな……。", "zh": "不过比起乐队，这更多是我在制作偶像的\n过程中积累的经验就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "88c1e182af26b07b0cbfed554838dfb26cb2cde713dfda0b81f133d8755239f6", "ja": "けど、ミスをしても、笑顔で最後までやりきる！\nステージに立つ者に必要なのは、その精神だと思うよ。", "zh": "不过，就算出了错，也要面带笑容坚持到最后！我觉得，站上舞台的人就需要这种精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "fbf6175f317904bc6b184902b5db5c839260437b8349f209cdea74c6252daf37", "ja": "ううっ……間違えた時にテンパりがちなありさに、\n{$P$}さんのアドバイスが染みます。", "zh": "呜呜……对一犯错就容易慌神的亚利沙来说，\n{$P$}先生的这番建议真是直戳心坎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "cc54cd6b01c687ce11b4495061eac219ba7da31ffe2e8c00c42b4e5558e146cf", "ja": "間違えても、笑顔で……わ、わかりました！\n{$P$}さん、やってみます！", "zh": "就算犯错，也要保持笑容……明、明白了！\n{$P$}先生，我会试试的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "98e99665fb870ec50ec36c08585388cbe2e1bbfcec3b5ff392edce3f34b96f99", "ja": "亜利沙さん、再生速度50％でどんと来～い♪\n道は遠～い♪　かかって来～い♪", "zh": "亚利沙，按播放速度50％放马过来～♪\n路还远着呢～尽管来吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "f5fbd3e4dc75c68a213dae078c8e9148dff5ea83316e83c43cd66ab05f8457bb", "ja": "可奈ちゃん……了解です！\nありさ、50％の速度で突っ走っちゃいますよ～！", "zh": "可奈……明白了！亚利沙要以50％的速度一路冲刺哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e41370d38b34816b45e10e5e5aece767b5dca0c250f5f8424822b22fabbb6818", "ja": "（そして、反復練習を重ねること数時間……）", "zh": "（然后，经过数小时的反复练习……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1026_se", "source_sha256": "6e087099515267531e1ddb5595c9a6b135e566428e9576fcb4d0a6664cede37f", "ja": "ジャーン……", "zh": "锵——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "6c217ed0f2d133e86524d47eb59a1d8166d41aabfd0d5b78311ab22ecb50da04", "ja": "はぁっ……はぁっ……。", "zh": "哈……哈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "d91ce5f962b2f007e85a07a88d8f7adee8e73690ca482054e4bb160bf2c2f13f", "ja": "はれっ？\nも、もしかして私たち……。", "zh": "咦？\n难、难道我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "20a3a8d4ad24cd587c261e637f18e8d78e9911c843951af2d676eb34c27b3237", "ja": "1曲完走できた～～～～っ！！", "zh": "完整演奏完1首了～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "20a3a8d4ad24cd587c261e637f18e8d78e9911c843951af2d676eb34c27b3237", "ja": "1曲完走できた～～～～っ！！", "zh": "完整演奏完1首了～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "20a3a8d4ad24cd587c261e637f18e8d78e9911c843951af2d676eb34c27b3237", "ja": "1曲完走できた～～～～っ！！", "zh": "完整演奏完1首了～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "4dfa87caf9a509583c1d3cbf0190b6633c2ec7531354c2b57bfbd1512b913726", "ja": "や、やりましたよぉ～！　\nありさたちの練習が、とうとう実を結びましたっ！", "zh": "我、我们做到了～！\n我们这些人的练习，终于开花结果了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "0a9d91e369862ebd5b7e44a7959eb22e61f6ea9719236c087e532f1795b0a54c", "ja": "やっと、ジュリアさんに報告できそうです～！\nよかったぁ……ぐすっ。", "zh": "终于能向茱莉亚先生汇报了～！\n太好了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0172_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0172_story_04_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "77f5225f2a2beddba52ee596343eb5b8695337783ca1c576115205852edb356a", "ja": "速度50％だけど、一歩前進だね！　どう？\n{$P$}！　ほめていいよ♪", "zh": "虽然只有速度50％，但也是前进了一步呢！怎么样？{$P$}！可以夸夸我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
